frp 0.71.0 reverse proxy integration for OPNsense, covering both daemons.

The package installs the frps server and the frpc client, an rc.d service and
configd actions for each side, and a VPN page that edits the TOML documents the
daemons actually read.  Neither daemon is started by the installer: frps needs
an authentication token, a dashboard user and password, and an allowed remote
port range before it is safe to accept clients.
